# The same goes for the VOICE: Piper and Kokoro add noise on purpose, so no
# two clips of one phrase are alike, and cycle 6 called the round trip
# WRONG because one clip in ~13 swallowed a syllable ("Пверка"). So every  # cyrillic-ok: what was heard
